      "content": "That's a helpful way to frame it for a client, but can we get a bit more granular on the actual mechanism? Specifically, how does Leucine interact with Sestrin2 and the Rag GTPases to actually initiate that mTORC1 activation? I want to make sure I have the biochemical signaling sequence right.",
