      "content": "Wait, why did you call leucine a \"goblin\"? That's a weird way to describe a branched-chain amino acid. Can we just stick to the actual molecular biology? I need to explain the dissociation of Sestrin2 from the GATOR complex without using any metaphors or characterizations like that.",
